WEBVTT

00:00.256 --> 00:03.285
Welcome to Deal Lens, your workspace for managing the

00:03.328 --> 00:05.556
legal side of buying or selling a company.

00:07.372 --> 00:11.233
Start by naming your deal, choosing a side and then clicking Create deal.

00:12.561 --> 00:15.291
In Deal Map, open an issue like share ownership.

00:17.640 --> 00:20.360
Answer the questions. The risk rating updates as you go.

00:22.330 --> 00:25.082
Once you’re done, suggested actions appear on the right.

00:27.989 --> 00:31.787
Select the actions you want to follow up. Then add them to Deal Hub.

00:32.930 --> 00:35.661
Deal Hub shows your open issues and follow-up tasks.

00:37.827 --> 00:40.609
In Task Board, drag a card to update its status.

00:43.261 --> 00:44.691
Or switch to the table view.

00:46.368 --> 00:49.227
In Action Library, browse suggested steps by issue.

00:52.275 --> 00:53.641
Add any that fit your deal.

00:57.049 --> 01:00.676
In Company Radar, search Companies House and select the right company.

01:03.095 --> 01:06.098
Review the points to check. Then add a follow-up to Deal Hub.

01:07.402 --> 01:09.535
In Settings, sign in to save your deal,

01:09.706 --> 01:10.836
change the app appearance,

01:10.986 --> 01:13.311
or view the privacy notice and terms of use.

01:15.224 --> 01:17.388
You’re now ready to explore Deal Lens.
